# Beats — the news desk
#
# The Newscaster reports the room back to itself: a live count of the
# detained, and — once the Algorithm is exposed — the only headline that
# ever mattered.

== breaking_news(guest)
  cast: Newscaster, guest
  NEWSCASTER
    Tonight's top story — {count(Internet.occupants)} packets currently detained in the Internet.
    <if: TheAlgorithm.revealed>
      And the shadow moderators have been UNMASKED as the Algorithm itself.
      You heard it here. Back to you.
    <else>
      Officials continue to deny rumours of a hidden hand behind the bans.
      More at eleven.
